      "statement": "The WebSocketEnvelope (aliased BrijioEnvelope) is { type: 'message', id?, target?: { browserInstanceId?, tabId? }, payload: unknown }; routing is per-call and explicit via target, with no hidden session-level selected browser or selected tab state. parseBrijioEnvelope JSON-parses and structurally validates, returning BrijioErrorEnvelope codes invalid_json or invalid_message instead of throwing.",
